+Fixed L23=L25=I+J: independent local transfer and data-certificate audit
+
+Final bounded gate: PASS for the fixed-both local, auxiliary, copied-complement
+and complete data-prefix transfer. Full coverage and independently checked
+fallbacks are bound in Section6 below. There is no generic-basis parameter
+left and no argument here infers universal nonvanishing from a sample.
+The inherited scalar/compiler/analytic interfaces remain assumptions. All
+packaging writes by this audit are confined to the new candidate's review
+folder; the published PR39 checkout is untouched.
+
+1. Actual source lines and complements
+For H_h=I-J/9 and a triple indicator t, the normalized line projector has
+p=t, xi=t^t H_h/2. Under L_h=I+J and L_h^-1=I-J/(h+1),
+ p'=t+3*1, xi'=t^t/2-5*1^t/[3(h+1)].
+At h23, xi'=31/72 on the triple and-5/72 elsewhere; products p'_i xi'_i
+are31/18 and-5/24. At h25, products are68/39 and-5/26. Every primal and
+dual coordinate is nonzero, and their products sum to one. No h25 or h47
+constant is reused for h23. The independent local_transfer.py checks every
+one of the1771+2300 source triples exactly with Fractions.
+
+For retained center U_i=ker(1^t-3e_i^t), put
+ p=e_i+2*1/(h-9), xi=(h-9)*1^t/12-(h-9)*e_i^t/4.
+Then Hp=e_i-1/3*1, xi p=1, and p xi projects onto U_i-perp.
+After I+J the normalized pair is
+ p'=e_i+(3h-7)*1/(h-9),
+ xi'=(h-9)*1^t/[3(h+1)]-(h-9)*e_i^t/4.
+At23 this is p'=e_i+31*1/7, xi'=7*1^t/36-7*e_i^t/2.
+At25 it is p'=e_i+17*1/4, xi'=8*1^t/39-4*e_i^t.
+All coordinates are nonzero. The exact independent controls check all48
+center pairs, normalization and the conjugation formulas. These complement
+rank-one calls are valid in the fixed bases; they need no generic adjustment.
+
+2. One actual controlled permutation family
+Use a23,b25,m575,d47 with R=[0..22,22,0..22], C=[0..22,0,0..22].
+Prescribe each M_beta row by first-d R and last-d C, with physical index
+25*alpha+beta. The independent script checks every row/column prescription
+and permutation completion. First23/last23 corner of A tensor(v nu) is
+ diag(v_0,...,v_22) A diag(nu_2,...,nu_24).
+First25/last25 corner of(p xi) tensor B is
